# Xcode Build & Test

**NEVER** use `swift test` or `swift build` — SwiftData macros require the Xcode build system. Always use `xcodebuild`.

**DEVELOPER_DIR** must point to `~/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer` because `xcode-select` is set to Command Line Tools, not full Xcode. **Always** prefix every `xcodebuild` call with this environment variable.

For SPM package tests, also add `PATH="/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin:$PATH"` so `simctl` is found.

## Build

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild build -scheme FitnessApp -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' 2>&1 | tail -30
```

## Unit Tests

All unit tests live in SPM packages — there is no app-level `FitnessAppTests` target. Use the "Package Tests" section below to run them without building the app.

## UI Tests

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild test -scheme FitnessApp -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -only-testing:FitnessAppUITests 2>&1 | tail -30
```

## Package Tests (SPM)

SPM test targets are **not** in the app scheme. Run them via the **package's own scheme** from the package directory. Always add `-skipMacroValidation` (required for swift-testing macros).

### Single package

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp/Packages/FitnessTraining && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer PATH="/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin:$PATH" xcodebuild test -scheme FitnessTraining -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -skipMacroValidation 2>&1 | tail -30
```

### All packages

```bash
for pkg in FitnessExercise FitnessTraining FitnessAnalytics FitnessStorage FitnessProfile; do
  echo "=== Testing $pkg ===" && \
  cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp/Packages/$pkg && \
  DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer PATH="/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin:$PATH" xcodebuild test -scheme $pkg -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -skipMacroValidation 2>&1 | tail -10
done
```

## Notes

- **Scheme**: Use `FitnessApp` for app/UI tests, use the package name for SPM package tests.
- **Simulator**: `iPhone 17 Pro Max`. Boot it first if needed: `DEVELOPER_DIR=... .../usr/bin/simctl boot <UDID>`
- To run a **single test**, append the test class and method: `-only-testing:FitnessAppUITests/TrainingUITests/testFullTrainingFlow`
- To run **all UI tests**, use: `-only-testing:FitnessAppUITests`
- Set `block_until_ms` to `300000` (5 min) since build + test takes ~90–120 seconds.
- Always add `-skipMacroValidation` when running package tests via CLI.
